Encyclopaedia
BULLDOZER: This is the unique contruction unit. It permits to level down an area before a building can be erected. This is also the only device able to capture an enemy headquarter and thus to acquire enemy technology. Keep in mind : bulldozer is a key unit, allways keep a factory operationnal with sufficient resources to produce at least one bulldozer.
TRUCK: Used only for ore transport shuttle between mine site and smelting furnace. This unit behave automaticaly and collect ore from the closest mine then supply the closest smelting furnace. It also automacally go refueling the closest refinery when needed.
GAS TRUCK: Used for ground units refuling, this unit chase automatically other units when their fuel tank is low and when fuel stock is equal or greater than 5000. When its job is done the gastruck goes automatically back to the closest refinery.
FIRE ENGINE: This vehicle is a ground fire fighting unit and building repairing. It is a key device cause it is the only that can repair buildings. In priority it automatically goes to put fire off buildings cause a building on fire takes damages and will certainly destroyed without any intervention. When after all fires have been extinguished then fire engines keep hosing damaged building to repair them but gold is required to accomplish this task.
JEEP: Low cost, fast but very weak this unit is used as a scouting vehicle. Its speed allows this unit to escape from ennemy attacks. It is also fitted with a 0.5in machine gun and therefore can be used as an anti aircraft mobile unit.
FLAK TRUCK: With the development of air war, ground strategic commanders realised they could conduct any invasion without protection against tactical bombers and tank busters. Therefore specific 20mm machine gun has been designed to provide a significant anti-aircraft defense. Mounted on truck chassis it is very mobile and could operate rapidely under air to ground attacks.
ARTILLERY: The mobile artillery unit uses the 4in gun. This is a long range gun quite accurate that inflicts severe damages. Artillery is very efficient on buildings and bunkers, but its weakness and slow reactions made it very vulnerable if it is not escorted by sufficient tanks.
HEAVY ARTILLERY: The Heavy Artillery unit is an improved mobile artillery with extended fire power and better resistance. These improments make this unit a very destructive one. The long range 5 in gun can inflict tremendous damages on a wide area. It takes time to reload but opponents better say their prayer the it is ready to fire.
LIGHT TANK: This armoured unit was the earlier tank prototype that replaced cavalry troops on battle fields. The pilot was also in charge of the gun he had to reload manualy. This is a very low cost unit but its main weakness is its maximun speed of 20Km/h and the poor fire power of its 1.5 in gun.
TANK: Quick and cheap to produce, good speed, but quite weak and poor fire power. Good only for "blitz krieg". The earlier version of this tank was fitted with a 2 in gun and was soon upgraded with a 3 in gun which made this unit more efficient against heavier tanks.
MEDIUM TANK: Good speed and good fire power at reasonable cost. Its well balanced design features make this tank an all purpose attack unit.
HEAVY TANK: Heavyly armoured and fitted with the dreadful 3.5in gun, this tank hardly progress on the battle field inspiring the greatest terror. However its production requires large expenses and many hours of hard work, but if you can afford a number of them then you have not to fear anything on battle ground, except aircrafts mayby...
SUPER HEAVY TANK: This Leviathan is a Psycho creation, it is the meeting of the Heavy Artillery and the Heavy Tank. Every feature of this wheeled battleship includes the term "heavy" : heavy armour, heavy fire power and heavy cost.
ROCKET HALFTRACK: Schyzo scientists used rocket weapons on many supports. This armoured car fitted with a rocket launcher was one of their best success. Lightly armoured but fast, this unit takes advantage of the rockets firing range and their awful damage. The problem is the poor accuracy of rockets.
TOXIC LAUNCHER: After many years of awful experiences on P.O.W., Paranoes became experts in chemical war. The first of them was Doctor Engel Nikloz whose sick brain gave the formula of a deadly gas of which a single molecule could inflict an instant death. In due course rocket engineers adapted a special warhead on a missile launcher with the undisguised intention to use this new weapon on ennemy populations.
TANKER: Designed for oil supply shuttle between oil plateform and refinery. This unit behave automaticaly and collect oil from the closest mine then supply the closest refinery. Also used as navy refuling ship.
FIRE BOAT: The fire boat is the navy version of the fire engine. It has been designed especially for oil rigs fire. Like the fire engine, this unit behave automatically when coastal contruction or oil rigs or on fire. It also repair damaged construction when hosing them for a while.
TROOP TRANSPORT: Specialy designed for ground units beaching. A troop transport can carry up to four ground units.
SUBMARINE: This is the perfect sneaky answer to these proud city sized war vessels. When dived the submarine has only one enemy : the silly little destroyer. Hopefully submarine experts added aft tubes that allow to fire torpedoes at destroyers while trying to evade.
DESTROYER: Designed for anti submarine and anti aircraft defense ship. Essential for convoy and war vessels escort, but weak in navy attacks.
CRUISER: Strong fire power and anti-aircraft defense. This an all purpose attack vessel. But no anti-submarine weapon. Bow turrets are also upgradable with rocket launchers when available.
BATTLESHIP: Tremendous fire power ! Heavy armor. This is a huge destruction vessel. Do not leave it without escort cause its submarine favorite dish.
AIRCRAFT CARRIER: The aircraft carrier can carry up to 8 navy aircraft such as the navy fighter or the navy bomber. This is a real floating airport, where aircraft can be maintained and refueled. The aircraft carrier is a very powerful attack unit but it is also very weak outside a navy taskforce.
SUICIDE BOAT: Fanatoes are fierce warriors that never accept defeat and prefer suicide to surrender. In their ultimate quest for victory their developed suicide PT boat units. These units composed of 3 to 5 PT boats loaded of TNT were rushing into enemy harbours, usually at night, charging straight onto big fishs like carriers or battleships. The tremendous impact could sunk heaviest ship but few could reach their target.
HOVERCRAFT: Landing is the key point of an invasion, at that crucial moment a war can be won or everything can be lost. Normoes improved significantly their landing technique when they designed a new kind of landing craft using air cushion technology. This huge box is floating over the surface of the water without touching it, therefore it behaves more like an aircraft than a boat. Like standard transport it carries up to 4 ground units. It is naturally immune to submarine attacks.
FIGHTER: Low range but high speed and very good manoeuvrability makes this fighter the best choice for sky defense against bomber raids
NAVY FIGHTER: This fighter has been designed to land on an aircraft carrier. It can also be fitted with Air/Ground rockets when available.This is a decisive weapon in navy plans.
SUPER FIGHTER: This fighter has almost all the qualities of the fighter PLUS a longer range of action that allow it to be used on bombing raids as an escorter.
TACTICAL BOMBER: This is in fact a medium range fighter with dive bombing capability. Good for attack or defense medium range mission, but not very good air fighter. It is upgradable with fire bombs that makes fire damages on a wide area and set fire on buildings.
NAVY BOMBER: This a medium range carpet bomber. Since it could not reach very far targets, engineers modified it to make it able to take off from an aircraft carrier. Therefore when it is under protections of navy fighters escort in a navy taskforce, this bomber becomes a fearsome attack aircraft.
HEAVY BOMBER: Designed for long range carpet bombing, the bomber inflict heavy damage in the bombing zone. But without air defense its an easy prey for fighters.
FLYING FORTRESS: Robert Onestone became the most famous Schyzo physician when he discovered how to produce an atomic chain reaction. Onestone could calculate the energy emited by the reaction but didn't know what practical effect would have the explosion on things and beings. He permits to design the first atomic bomb. When tests proved the utter destruction provoqued by his invention he tried to burn his notes and died in the fire of his laboratory.
KAMIKAZE: Only Fanatics could end to use such a weapon. Hundreds of Fanatic pilots took off for their last mission, heading to target their aircraft loaded with tons of TNT, sacrificing their life for their sole honour and to enter the god heroes Pantheon.
JET FIGHTER: Normo aircraft engineers took benefit from rocket liquid fuel application and made a significant technologic leap with the design of the first turbo-reactor propulsing air into the combustion chamber to obtain high velocity gaz. Two of these reactors had been equiped on a new fighter model designed to resist high thrust and speed that reached 870Km/h. It received latest weaponery such as air-ground and new air-air rockets that proved devastating against bombers and fighters.
GUN BATTERY: This battery shelters the powerfull 4in gun mounted on turret. When built up on a defense line, it proved very hard to cross through. Defenseless against air attacks.
FLAK BATTERY: When the 3.5in gun was invented it appears it was very efficient when aimed to the sky. Not a long time later it became Air Force pilots nigthmare.
ROCKET BATTERY: The rocket battery launches bursts of three 1in rockets. The damages inflicted by rockets made this defense allmost impassable. Except if danger comes from the air.
SUPER GUN: This super gun is a Parano invention. It is composed of a 24in gun carried on a railway wagon. Such canon could shoot a 2500lb shell at a range of 10Km and at a rate of one shot per hour. With this weapon Parano scientist reached the limits of guns technology and focused their researches on rocket engines.
BUZZ BOMB RAMP: After several tries ended by failure, Psycho scientists definitely turned their back on super guns project, when one of their rocket specialist invented a new liquid fuel for rocket engines. His research leaded to the first long range rocket that could fly from a continent to an other. Because of the noise produced by the engine, they call it the buzz bomb.
